* QuarkTex ogles2.library: the PiStorm/Emu68 ogles2.library's shared library
* interface (dispatch ABI 1, stage 1: a context clears and shows a colour;
* most GL entries are stubs, see docs/phase9-ogles2.md).
* LVO -30 returns the dispatch table; -36 is called by OGLES2Close() before
* CloseLibrary (found by disassembling libogles2.a's OGLES2Close -- it is
* undocumented in the SDK headers, presumably flushing a debug log the real
* PiStorm library keeps; a no-op here).
##base _OGLES2Base
##bias 30
OGLES2GetDispatchTable()()
OGLES2PrivateLogFlush()()
##end
